WEBVTT

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.990
Hey, bro!

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.490
Let's play!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:16.480
Ugh.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.490
No way.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.170
How can I play with a kid 
six years younger than me?

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.260
It's morning!

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.230
My body hurts.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.560
I'm dying.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.150
Get up. Get up.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:45.270
Please no...

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.010
Wake up.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:50.610
You sure are excited this morning, Gion.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.010
It's because I've never done 
anything like this before.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.400
Rugby's a blast by itself,

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:58.340
but having fun with the guys feels like
I've gained a bunch of brothers.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.460
Respect your elders.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:14.350
"Rugby's a blast," huh?

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.300
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.550
Say that after you've learned to actually
<i>catch </i>the ball, you piece of trash!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.420
Ow...

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:25.140
I don't have time to teach trash!

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:29.040
What's this, Ebucchi?
You're already abandoning your protégé?

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.480
Don't worry, Gion. I'll teach you.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.750
Dammit.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.180
I'll get him back when we start tackling.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.850
Okay, let's break for lunch.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.140
Meet on the field at 2:30.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:50.750
Yes, sir.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.220
We'll run a Gewalt this afternoon.

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:53.750
A what?

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:59.260
Oh, right. You kids don't call it that.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.960
It's an intrasquad game.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:51.020
<b>Episode 7
"I Want to Be Able
 to Do Everything"</b>

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.710
Come on, get in line.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.500
We'll play 12-on-12.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.010
The starters will be Team A.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:18.520
The reserve players will be Team B.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.530
I'm on Team A?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.320
He's on Team A?

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.570
I'm a starter!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.830
Well, just means we've gotta crush 'em.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.560
Team A will kick off.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.210
Begin.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:43.160
I didn't know rugby could be played 12-on-12.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.570
They're doing that because 
we don't have a lot of players.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:48.470
They're missing two forwards 
and one back each.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.440
I'll show them what I can do and 
get myself moved to Team A—

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.480
Seriously?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:00.860
Ow...

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.610
All right!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.730
Stop celebrating and get the ball, Gion!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:10.950
He really is stupidly good at tackling.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.790
One more!

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:21.590
Wait, Gion!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.610
There's another player behind him!

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:29.090
There's more to rugby 
than just tackling, idiot.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.100
Crap, it's Ebumi!

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.940
H-He's so fast.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.190
Dammit.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.090
Take that!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.590
Gion!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:58.170
Huh?

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.300
Knock-on.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.690
Gion-kun still can't catch the ball.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.180
What? Still?

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:27.490
All right.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.720
He dropped the ball!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:31.870
Get it back!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.210
Gion-kun, you're too far forward.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.990
That shrimp is the weak link in their line.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.940
14-0.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.230
Team B is leading after the first half.

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:13.120
Team A is losing because...

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.110
...of you.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.320
What?

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.120
Why? Sir.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.170
Five tackles.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.090
Two of them successful, 
three of them failures.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:28.250
You ran into your teammates three times.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.760
You've made zero passes and zero catches.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.380
You're right that I didn't get the ball...

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:39.060
but I'll tackle our opponents 
to the ground to make up for it.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.020
So...

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.430
Is tackling all you want to do?

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.780
While your forwards get covered in mud...

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:52.780
and your backs sweat to 
get your team the ball...

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:57.760
are you going to let it bobble about on 
the deck just so you can tackle someone?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.780
Have you ever played any other sports?

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.290
No.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.200
I didn't think so.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:24.180
You'd never make it anywhere 
with your selfish playing style.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:30.110
I'm subbing you out.
Let's get the second half underway.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:40.870
<b>Club 
Application</b>

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:40.870
<i>My brother never let me play with him.</i>

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.480
<i>I wanted to play a team sport.</i>

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.380
<i>Sports are more fun when you play on a team.</i>

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:53.800
A gnat like you buzzing around on court
is just getting in our way.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:59.220
You suck.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.220
You're in the way, short stuff.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.680
When I'm in middle school, 
I'll get a jillion times bigger!

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.150
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.320
Let's go play with the guys over there.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:15.990
<b>Club Application 
Basketball Team 
Class 1-C     Number 9    Gion Kenji</b>

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.990
<i>I wanted to play on a team.</i>

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:19.990
You really want to play basketball
at <i>your</i> height?

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.500
What are you doing?

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.910
Stop!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:29.850
<i>Since then, I ended up getting 
into scraps everywhere I went.</i>

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:37.540
<i>But in elementary and middle school,
there were guys my height everywhere.</i>

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:42.420
<i>They were able to play on teams...</i>

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:48.600
<i>Was I...</i>

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.030
<i>Was I the problem?</i>

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.200
<i>Lame.</i>

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.000
<b>Hey, Maroudo.</b>

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.980
You're in for Gion. 
Get out there.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.980
...Th-This is 
awkward...

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.120
Full time.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.120
<b>Intrasquad Game!</b>

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.120
<b>First Half</b>

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.120
<b>Second Half</b>

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:47.120
Team B wins 21-12.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.520
All right!

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:52.440
The losing team will
practice tackling for an hour.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:55.130
What?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.600
Team B, get out of here.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.010
All right!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.000
Let's go get some ice cream.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.620
Again!

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.820
Iwashimizu, focus!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.280
Y-Yes, sir.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.170
It's because I've never done 
anything like this before.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.260
Team A, wrap up.

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:43.860
We'll start again tomorrow at five.

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.290
Get plenty of rest.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.290
Yes, sir!

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.910
Why were you so hard on him?

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:14.350
Gion-kun only started 
playing rugby a month ago...

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:14.790
No.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.550
That midget hasn't even 
begun to play rugby yet.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:39.570
Hey, we can't find Gion anywhere.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.920
What?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:44.390
He'll probably show up when he gets hungry.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:56.230
Hey! If you're there, say something!

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.670
Gion, are you there?

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.450
"Creak"?

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:11.180
There's no way he'd fit in there.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:19.560
What a pain in the ass.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.810
Well, his things are still here...

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.500
He's probably just upset 
and hiding somewhere.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.950
Let's leave him be for a while.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.530
That shrimp hasn't...

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.750
Hey, Gion-kun.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:29.130
I know you tackle all the time...

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:33.210
But do you do it to take the ball
from your opponents?

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.260
Or are you...

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:40.370
taking out your frustrations 
against all the big guys...

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:46.070
who have said mean things to you... on us?

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:56.040
Oh, u-um... I-I'm not
telling you not to tackle...

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.580
I just...

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:04.020
I can catch the ball,
b-but I'm no good at scrums.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.120
I'm no good at kicking, either.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:09.030
I'm not a smart player, either.

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:13.080
I'm not fast like Ebumi-senpai.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.930
I'm not strong like the captain.

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:20.180
I can't do those low tackles you do, either.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:22.980
But...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.840
I want to be able to do everything.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.620
That's why I practice.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:36.120
After all, once I learn to do all that...

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:42.000
We'll be able to get our ball back.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:46.290
That's our ball he's got!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.760
In our game against Keijo,

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:53.510
I hadn't gotten over what happened
in my middle school days.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:58.520
But, the moment you said that,

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:03.020
I became a part of the Jinko rugby team.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:32.550
Okay, that's enough for 
early morning practice.

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:36.810
Take a break and grab breakfast,
and then we'll start on weights.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:42.810
This afternoon, we'll do another Gewalt 
to finish off the training camp.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.440
Seriously?

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.560
Ugh...

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.440
I guess I'll be starting again.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.030
After all, I was in the lineup 
when we played Keijo.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:59.240
If anything, I don't understand 
why he was a starter yesterday.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.500
That's it!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.520
Get him!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.260
All right!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:18.520
Dropped it!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:19.780
Good!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:20.760
Get it back!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:22.770
Got it!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.270
Dammit!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:31.200
Hey. If you're just going to stare,
put those balls away.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:12.520
Did you just pass to the big guy?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:21.200
I'll let you play.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:26.040
Just for the last five minutes.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.050
We're up six points right now.

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:41.260
Stand strong, Gion.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:49.200
Okay, let's get one last try.

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:51.250
They stole the ball.

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.220
It's wide open!

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:58.190
If they score a try, 
they'll have clawed us back!

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:04.650
<i>The ball...</i>

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:08.910
Gion!

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:16.370
<i>When I tackled someone, they called 
me amazing for the first time.</i>

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.180
<i>Of course I want them to keep saying it...</i>

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.370
<i>I don't want to do anything...</i>

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:28.680
<i>that won't make them say it.</i>

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:41.200
Give me the ball, you little runt.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.440
What?!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.220
Gion. Gion...

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.480
Pass the ball.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.730
Tch.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.600
Good job, Gion.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:27.460
We won.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:28.370
What?

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.090
We were six points ahead.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.320
If Ebucchi'd scored there,
and they'd made the conversion,

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:36.070
they'd have scored seven points
and overturned our lead.

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:38.140
That was close.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.680
That was a great try-saving pick-up.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:41.440
Huh?

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:46.390
Thanks for protecting the ball.

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:53.100
Gather round.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.240
You guys still have a lot to learn.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:02.900
But you've started consciously 
lowering your postures.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:06.670
You've gotten better at 
moving the ball around.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:10.770
Having a play style is a good thing.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.060
But, if you're just doing it for yourselves,

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:17.040
then your style is worthless.

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:21.700
Don't play for yourselves.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:27.050
Whether it's tackling, scrums, 
or tries, do it for the team.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:33.810
I have a feeling the team's 
gained a new member.

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:37.340
What was that for?!

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.440
Congratulations on joining the team, Gion!

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:41.730
Congratulations.

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.250
Congratulations!

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:46.840
What's wrong with you guys?

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:47.800
Hey!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:53.570
Then, to celebrate me joining the team,
buy us dinner tonight, Gramps.

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:55.580
Besides, the training camp's over now.

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:58.840
Gion, you idiot!

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.410
Respect your elders!

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:00.410
Sure.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.960
If you can be ready by five.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.250
We only have fifteen minutes?

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:08.160
Hurry!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.300
There's no time to get changed!

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:10.300
Nicely done, Gion!

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.340
You're today's MVP!

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Next Time: "Ball Games"</b>

00:23:46.220 --> 00:23:49.090
Next time: "Ball Games."
